"content": "<h1>俄巴路</h1><p>在<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Gen10:28\">創世記十章28節</a>中，俄巴路是約坍的後裔以巴錄的另一種拼寫方式。<em>見</em><span data-bnType=\"resourceReference\" data-resourceId=\"4091\" data-resourceType=\"TyndaleBibleDictionary\">以巴錄 #2</span>。</p>",
