"language": "zht",
"review_level": "None",
"content": "<h1>蛾摩拉</h1><p>蛾摩拉是「平原上的城」之一（<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Gen19:1-Gen19:38\">創19章</a>），因其罪惡極深，而遭神毀滅。</p><p><em>見</em> <span data-bnType=\"resourceReference\" data-resourceId=\"3739\" data-resourceType=\"TyndaleBibleDictionary\">平原上的城</span>；<span data-bnType=\"resourceReference\" data-resourceId=\"7725\" data-resourceType=\"TyndaleBibleDictionary\">所多瑪和蛾摩拉</span>。</p>",
